WEBVTT

00:15.966 --> 00:17.593
Like that...

00:19.102 --> 00:20.660
All right, it's done!

00:24.708 --> 00:26.801
Oh, that smells great!

00:26.877 --> 00:31.405
Paella needs to be fluffy yet firm, without making the rice too sticky.

00:31.481 --> 00:35.577
The point's to get it to a boil quick on high heat once the soup's in.

00:35.652 --> 00:37.517
Oh, I see.

00:38.655 --> 00:40.054
All right!

00:40.123 --> 00:43.388
Now let it simmer 20 minutes like this, and it's done.

00:43.460 --> 00:45.325
I'm a little surprised...

00:45.395 --> 00:47.556
Sorata, you'd make a great wife.

00:47.631 --> 00:48.757
Oh, really?

00:49.799 --> 00:51.994
Yuzuriha, will you do the honors?

00:56.139 --> 00:59.131
Missie, you're good at handling swords...

00:59.209 --> 01:01.700
...but not kitchen knives at all.

01:01.778 --> 01:05.145
I haven't done anything resembling cooking, so...

01:05.215 --> 01:08.480
Okay, how you slice onions...

01:21.131 --> 01:23.258
Don't worry about it too much.

01:23.333 --> 01:26.666
Get the hang of it, and you can do it in a jiffy, too.

01:26.736 --> 01:31.298
Sorata, I can't get this bottle of pickles open!

01:31.374 --> 01:33.001
Sure, leave that to me!

01:34.210 --> 01:39.341
Wow, in times like this a man is very reliable after all!

01:39.416 --> 01:40.940
You can always call for me.

01:41.017 --> 01:43.349
I'll always fly over to help!

01:43.420 --> 01:45.012
Isn't that a little much?

01:45.088 --> 01:46.350
Yeah?

01:46.423 --> 01:47.856
You're funny.

01:49.659 --> 01:53.561
Episode 20
Ripple

02:13.316 --> 02:14.840
You want to aim...

02:15.885 --> 02:17.011
...here.

02:19.656 --> 02:21.419
What's wrong?

02:21.491 --> 02:24.460
If you break me here, I will die.

02:26.396 --> 02:27.954
Fuma...

02:28.031 --> 02:29.760
Why...

02:29.833 --> 02:31.232
Why?

02:31.301 --> 02:33.496
You had such a good chance...

02:34.537 --> 02:35.504
...Kamui!

02:42.712 --> 02:44.009
I'm coming in.

02:48.051 --> 02:49.643
The food's ready.

02:52.622 --> 02:54.146
I'm fine.

02:54.224 --> 02:56.283
I'm sure I'd trouble everyone.

03:03.900 --> 03:05.925
Are you worried about Fuma?

03:08.705 --> 03:10.900
If I had my head on straight...

03:10.974 --> 03:12.737
...Saiki wouldn't have died.

03:13.777 --> 03:15.244
And Subaru...

03:17.013 --> 03:18.844
Kamui...

03:18.915 --> 03:21.577
I never say anything decent to you.

03:23.019 --> 03:27.922
It's not like my life's so good that I can teach something to others.

03:27.991 --> 03:30.755
But I can say one thing with pride.

03:31.895 --> 03:33.487
Regret is something...

03:33.563 --> 03:37.226
...that makes you think how to do things so you don't feel it again.

03:39.235 --> 03:41.795
Kamui, you've regretted enough, right?

03:41.871 --> 03:46.331
Then look forward and take even one step further than now!

03:48.545 --> 03:49.512
That's true.

03:53.750 --> 03:55.411
Otherwise...

03:55.485 --> 03:57.817
...I'll end up regretting again.

03:59.756 --> 04:01.781
And to do that, you have to eat up!

04:01.858 --> 04:04.827
Eating yummy food will get you all full of energy!

04:04.894 --> 04:06.623
Hey, doesn't this look good?

04:06.696 --> 04:12.134
My paella, Yuzuriha's wraps, and missie's salad and soup!

04:13.103 --> 04:14.070
Amazing.

04:15.271 --> 04:17.205
Please eat lots!

04:18.108 --> 04:19.075
I'll have some.

04:26.649 --> 04:29.675
Well then, time to eat!

04:29.753 --> 04:30.879
I'm gonna eat up!

04:30.954 --> 04:32.444
- Time to eat!
- I'll have some.

04:32.522 --> 04:35.457
Kamui, I made these wraps by myself!

04:35.525 --> 04:36.958
Oh, thanks.

04:37.026 --> 04:38.653
Wow! Delicious!

04:38.728 --> 04:40.923
Missie's salad is really tasty!

04:40.997 --> 04:43.727
Wow, you're right! It's great!

04:43.800 --> 04:45.927
Arashi, you're a great cook!

04:53.309 --> 04:54.435
Amazing.

04:55.645 --> 05:00.014
Making someone refusing to eat regain their desire for food...

05:01.384 --> 05:03.249
It's not amazing at all.

05:03.319 --> 05:05.480
Kamui decided for himself.

05:05.555 --> 05:08.854
But it was because you said something...

05:08.925 --> 05:11.485
...that he decided to eat like that, right?

05:13.029 --> 05:16.430
To eat means to live...

05:32.882 --> 05:34.543
What are you looking at?

05:36.252 --> 05:37.719
I was thinking...

05:39.656 --> 05:40.782
To eat...

05:42.225 --> 05:43.351
...or to stop.

05:44.594 --> 05:47.995
If there was meaning to live on even by eating trash...

06:03.379 --> 06:05.108
Don't you want to eat?

06:06.249 --> 06:08.410
I haven't decided yet.

06:08.484 --> 06:12.284
To live on or to continue like this until I die.

06:12.355 --> 06:14.550
I was thinking there's no change...

06:14.624 --> 06:19.118
...whether or not my lonely self lives or dies.

06:22.432 --> 06:23.399
Arashi.

06:24.434 --> 06:29.098
A life that ends without touching a soul or finding kindred people...

06:29.172 --> 06:33.006
...truly is just like being dead while alive.

06:34.811 --> 06:36.244
However, Arashi...

06:36.312 --> 06:39.839
...you will meet many people in the future.

06:41.885 --> 06:44.251
Those that look at you with interest...

06:44.320 --> 06:47.050
...and those that will carry a grudge.

06:47.123 --> 06:50.422
And someone that will love you.

07:03.239 --> 07:04.934
I have been waiting for you.

07:05.975 --> 07:07.567
Are you all right?

07:08.711 --> 07:12.477
I am sorry I have troubled you.

07:13.583 --> 07:17.542
Miss Yuzuriha, how are your wounds?

07:17.620 --> 07:18.780
I'm all right!

07:18.855 --> 07:20.652
I'm full of energy again!

07:21.858 --> 07:23.223
That puppy...

07:24.460 --> 07:26.291
It's Inuki!

07:26.362 --> 07:29.388
Come on, Inuki, say hello to Ms. Hinoto.

07:36.906 --> 07:38.430
Don't, Inuki!

07:38.508 --> 07:40.635
Come on, Inuki, what's wrong?

07:40.710 --> 07:42.871
Stop that! Jeez!

07:42.946 --> 07:44.675
No!

07:44.747 --> 07:46.339
Inuki, don't.

07:46.416 --> 07:49.146
What's wrong with you, Inuki?

07:49.218 --> 07:52.278
What, little Inuki is a little frustrated?

07:52.355 --> 07:54.915
I'm sorry, Ms. Hinoto.

07:54.991 --> 07:56.117
Not at all.

07:58.995 --> 08:02.089
You called us here because you wanted to talk?

08:02.165 --> 08:03.496
Yes.

08:03.566 --> 08:04.863
I saw a dream.

08:06.069 --> 08:09.402
A dream of where the Dragons of Earth will appear next.

08:09.472 --> 08:10.598
You found out?

08:11.774 --> 08:13.332
Yes.

08:13.409 --> 08:15.843
Where is it?

08:19.282 --> 08:21.273
They will appear next...

08:25.154 --> 08:27.452
Then why don't we split up?

08:27.523 --> 08:30.458
Missie, you and Yuzuriha go to Inogashira.

08:30.526 --> 08:31.493
- Okay.
- Okay!

08:31.561 --> 08:33.188
All right, I'm trusting you.

08:34.530 --> 08:38.159
Now, Kamui, we're gonna go to bright, old Ginza!

08:39.969 --> 08:41.960
Sorata really is...

08:55.418 --> 08:57.852
I don't feel much of anything.

08:57.920 --> 08:58.887
Right...

09:00.356 --> 09:01.345
Arashi?

09:01.424 --> 09:02.391
Yes?

09:02.458 --> 09:06.189
Arashi, what do you think of Sorata?

09:07.864 --> 09:09.297
W-Why do you ask?

09:11.734 --> 09:16.762
Because you looked really cute when you were seeing him off.

09:18.674 --> 09:20.608
C-Cute?

09:20.676 --> 09:23.042
Yes, you were really cute!

09:31.220 --> 09:33.586
I have someone, too.

09:33.656 --> 09:36.557
Someone that I look at in that way.

09:36.626 --> 09:39.789
I realized something after I fell in love.

09:40.830 --> 09:43.458
This is the place where the person I love lives...

09:43.533 --> 09:45.763
...so I don't want anyone to break it.

09:45.835 --> 09:47.769
I'll make sure to protect it.

09:48.971 --> 09:50.165
Yuzuriha...

09:53.443 --> 09:54.774
Right, Inuki?

09:54.844 --> 09:56.641
Let's do our best together!

09:57.880 --> 09:59.609
Isn't that right, Arashi?

10:01.617 --> 10:05.053
Sorata's a slightly strange guy, but he's awesome.

10:05.121 --> 10:07.589
You should do your best as well, Arashi.

10:07.657 --> 10:09.215
Yuzuriha, that's a little...

10:09.292 --> 10:10.589
It's all right!

10:10.660 --> 10:12.525
I completely understand.

10:12.595 --> 10:13.926
But that's...

10:13.996 --> 10:16.396
You're so cute, Arashi!

10:16.466 --> 10:18.195
You're blushing!

10:24.874 --> 10:26.865
It's coming from Inogashira!

10:41.824 --> 10:43.985
Kamui, I'm heading for Inogashira!

10:44.060 --> 10:45.027
All right!

10:46.696 --> 10:47.685
Please wait!

10:48.698 --> 10:49.665
Princess...

10:50.700 --> 10:53.863
There will be an earthquake here in Ginza soon.

10:54.904 --> 10:57.270
A Dragon of Earth'll show up here, too?

10:57.340 --> 10:59.433
Please remain here...

11:00.476 --> 11:02.171
Protect Ginza.

11:06.849 --> 11:07.816
Damn it!

11:12.221 --> 11:13.381
Sorata...

11:34.677 --> 11:35.803
On beishiramandaya sowaka.

11:35.945 --> 11:37.412
On beishiramandaya sowaka.

11:37.580 --> 11:38.706
On beishiramandaya sowaka.

11:38.848 --> 11:39.872
On beishiramandaya sowaka.

11:40.016 --> 11:41.449
On beishiramandaya sowaka.

11:41.584 --> 11:42.710
On beishiramandaya sowaka.

11:42.885 --> 11:44.079
On beishiramandaya sowaka.

11:44.220 --> 11:45.710
On beishiramandaya sowaka.

11:51.060 --> 11:52.687
I trust you, Gohoudouji.

11:52.762 --> 11:53.956
Protect the missie!

11:59.602 --> 12:01.160
It'll be right there!

12:15.184 --> 12:19.382
It would've been better to choose death when you were 7 years old.

12:22.592 --> 12:23.559
Pitiful.

12:24.594 --> 12:26.789
All you can do is watch.

12:29.966 --> 12:31.399
You're going to kill him.

12:32.635 --> 12:33.897
Don't you understand?

12:35.871 --> 12:38.305
I mean the man who will die for you.

12:54.223 --> 12:55.815
You're going to kill him.

13:52.848 --> 13:53.837
Sorata!

13:53.916 --> 13:55.577
On beishiramandaya sowaka.

13:55.718 --> 13:57.379
On beishiramandaya sowaka.

13:57.520 --> 13:59.215
On beishiramandaya sowaka.

13:59.355 --> 14:01.220
On beishiramandaya sowaka.

14:01.357 --> 14:03.086
On beishiramandaya sowaka.

14:03.225 --> 14:04.988
On beishiramandaya sowaka.

14:05.127 --> 14:06.992
On beishiramandaya sowaka.

14:07.129 --> 14:08.858
On beishiramandaya sowaka.

14:08.998 --> 14:10.898
On beishiramandaya sowaka.

14:11.033 --> 14:12.933
On beishiramandaya sowaka.

14:16.539 --> 14:18.803
Arashi, hurry and get out of there!

14:38.127 --> 14:40.095
Are you all right, Arashi?

14:40.162 --> 14:41.959
- Are you hurt?
- I'm not.

14:42.031 --> 14:43.498
But what was that...

14:43.566 --> 14:45.966
It saved your life, Arashi.

14:47.670 --> 14:48.659
Probably.

14:51.707 --> 14:52.674
It can't be!

14:59.382 --> 15:01.509
This is nothing.

15:02.551 --> 15:04.781
I mean, I did decide on you, missie.

15:07.256 --> 15:10.157
The one who I will sacrifice my life for.

15:11.627 --> 15:12.753
Sorata!

15:19.468 --> 15:20.935
Sorata, hang on!

15:24.240 --> 15:25.207
Sorata!

15:36.018 --> 15:37.849
Sorata!

15:37.920 --> 15:39.820
Sorata! Sorata!

15:42.224 --> 15:44.658
Missie, you're not hurt, right?

15:45.694 --> 15:46.718
I'm fine!

15:46.796 --> 15:48.525
Before that, you're the one...

15:51.000 --> 15:54.527
It's all okay if you're all right, missie.

16:01.844 --> 16:03.334
Sorata, hang on!

16:03.412 --> 16:04.379
Sorata...

16:04.447 --> 16:05.846
Sorata, hold on!

16:05.915 --> 16:06.882
Sorata!

16:06.949 --> 16:08.075
Sorata!

16:31.607 --> 16:32.904
Arashi.

16:32.975 --> 16:35.967
Sorata's right arm may never move again.

16:36.045 --> 16:37.012
That can't be...

16:37.079 --> 16:38.171
You're lying.

16:38.247 --> 16:39.441
That's so...

16:59.134 --> 17:01.227
It's you, missie...

17:01.303 --> 17:03.533
You're as beautiful as always.

17:21.724 --> 17:23.157
I was a little careless.

17:23.225 --> 17:25.352
I still have a long way to go.

17:30.499 --> 17:32.160
To protect me...

17:34.937 --> 17:36.370
Don't cry...

17:37.740 --> 17:40.607
I'm really weak when it comes to women crying...

17:41.644 --> 17:44.169
Wounds like this will heal real quick.

17:44.246 --> 17:47.147
When I'm better, I'll make you something yummy again.

17:47.216 --> 17:49.309
How about seafood spaghetti?

17:49.385 --> 17:51.444
Mine's really professional.

17:54.156 --> 17:56.124
You don't like Italian?

17:56.191 --> 17:57.988
How's Japanese food?

17:59.728 --> 18:01.127
Then we'll be slick.

18:01.196 --> 18:02.823
How about Mount Kouya food?

18:02.898 --> 18:04.729
It's tastier than you think.

18:08.337 --> 18:10.430
What about my feelings?

18:14.310 --> 18:16.676
You ignore my feelings...

18:16.745 --> 18:18.303
And get hurt like this...

18:18.380 --> 18:20.473
How I feel about you...

18:21.784 --> 18:23.376
I know...

18:23.452 --> 18:25.943
You don't feel anything for me...

18:27.423 --> 18:29.857
I did this on my own 'cause I wanted to.

18:29.925 --> 18:31.756
It has nothing to do with you.

18:31.827 --> 18:32.851
It does!

18:35.331 --> 18:40.860
Do you think I would be all right if you got hurt or even died?

18:43.505 --> 18:44.631
I...

18:45.874 --> 18:47.000
About you...

18:52.414 --> 18:54.712
Can I interpret that favorably?

18:55.751 --> 18:58.982
Can I believe that you think of me...

19:00.456 --> 19:01.753
...as a man?

19:07.997 --> 19:09.055
Don't cry.

19:10.099 --> 19:12.033
I'm really happy right now.

19:13.936 --> 19:16.632
I've never cried in front of someone before...

19:16.705 --> 19:18.969
I can't quite control it...

19:21.710 --> 19:25.305
Then I took your first time, missie.

19:32.688 --> 19:35.122
Can I get one more of your firsts?
